	(text "If any error occurs\n(BSPD, CT Disconnect, BPS Disconnect)\nThen it pulls the signal low.\n\nOtherwise, in no fault the diodes are reverse biased\nand anode pulled high. Error signal inverted."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 242.316 129.032 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
		)
		(uuid "cb5cee3d-ff11-4bf8-9fc1-58174d2e20d6")
	)
	(text "Brake Pressure Sensor ASL 200Bar\nVoltage range 0.5V-4.5V\n\nWant to trip at 25Bar\n\nVout = Vmin + (Pout/Ptotal * deltaV)\n     = 0.5 + (25/200 * 4)\n	 = 1.0V\n\nHigh threshold at 1.0V\nERROR Trips at 1.0V or over (e.g. sensor short to 12V)"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 229.362 42.164 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left)
		)
		(uuid "ce773f50-2e94-49bb-9ae8-9e196d4577d8")
	)
	(text "This goes LOW if\nBrake Pressure Disconnect"
